// The Ruling-1 demonstration, reject half: an INSERTED second Card-producing
// clause between a producer and its `That(Card)` read flips "resolves" to a
// LOAD ERROR — never to a silent re-bind ([CR#608.2d]; the R2 uniqueness
// gate). Without the middle clause this is the accept twin
// (accept/E-BIND-AMBIGUOUS/otherworldly-journey-shape.ron).
Normal(
  name: "Reject Insertion Repoints",
  types: [Instant],
  abilities: [
    Spell(effect: Targeted(
      targets: [TargetOne(Creature)],
      effect: Sequence([
        Move(It, Exile),
        Move(This, Exile),
        Move(That(Card), Battlefield),
      ]),
    )),
  ],
)
